tering is enabled. A value of 512 produces a radius equal to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the width of a tile. The default value is 50."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionclusterradius","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterRadius","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterRadius"}],"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClusterRadius"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource/initWithIdentifier:URL:options:":{"fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"initWithIdentifier:URL:options:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a shape source with an identifier, URL, and dictionary of options for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the source."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource\/initwithidentifier:url:options:","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource\/initWithIdentifier:URL:options:","title":"initWithIdentifier:URL:options:"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevel":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing an integer; specifies the maximum zoom level at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which to create vector tiles. A greater value produces greater detail at high"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"zoom levels. The default value is 18."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionmaximumzoomlevel","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevel","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevel"}],"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevel"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the content that forms the base map.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"MLNShape","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShape","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionClustered":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a Boolean enabling or disabling clustering."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shape"},{"type":"text","text":" property contains point shapes, setting this option to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YES"},{"type":"text","text":" clusters the points by radius into groups. The default value is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NO"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionclustered","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionClustered","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClustered"}],"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionClustered"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing an integer; specifies the minimum zoom level at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which to create vector tiles. The default value is 0."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionminimumzoomlevel","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel"}],"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMinimumZoomLevel"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing a double; specifies the Douglas-Peucker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"simplification tolerance. A greater value produces simpler geometries and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"improves performance. The default value is 0.375."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionsimplificationtolerance","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance"}],"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionSimplificationTolerance"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing an integer; specifies the size of the tile"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer on each side. A value of 0 produces no buffer. A value of 512 produces a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"buffer as wide as the tile itself. Larger values produce fewer rendering"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"artifacts near tile edges and slower performance. The default value is 128."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionbuffer","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer"}],"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionBuffer"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevelForClustering":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NSNumber"},{"type":"text","text":" object containing an integer; specifies the maximum zoom level at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which to cluster points if clustering is enabled. Defaults to one zoom level"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"less than the value of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevel","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" so that, at the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"maximum zoom level, the shapes are not clustered."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesourceoptionmaximumzoomlevelforclustering","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevelForClustering","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevelForClustering"}],"title":"MLNShapeSourceOptionMaximumZoomLevelForClustering"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/GeoJSON":{"kind":"article","title":"Working with GeoJSON Data","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/geojson","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/GeoJSON","abstract":[],"type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShapeSource":{"abstract":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a map content source that supplies vector shapes to be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"shown on the map. The shapes may be instances of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or they may be defined by local or external"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"GeoJSON"},{"type":"text","text":" code. A shape source is added to an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object along with an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object. The vector style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"layer defines the appearance of any content supplied by the shape source. You"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can update a shape source by setting its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shape"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URL"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshapesource","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShapeSource","fragments":[{"text":"MLNShapeSource","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"MLNShapeSource"}}}